/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/arcelormittal-ny-registered-shs-mt-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"MT 2019 Q4","e":"mt","d":"2020-02-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Daniel Fairclough","x":"And here, I refer specifically to iron ore, which weakened in recent weeks in a period where we usually see iron ore price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/arcelormittal-ny-registered-shs-mt-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"MT 2019 Q4","e":"mt","d":"2020-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bastian Synagowitz","x":"But could you give us any color on like how much is -- you baked at least into the 2020 number in terms of cost-cutting other than the exceptional events and so on?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/arcelormittal-ny-registered-shs-mt-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"MT 2019 Q4","e":"mt","d":"2020-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Seth R. Rosenfeld","x":"How do you expect that to progress moving forward, recognizing at the same thing you do have a cost-saving program?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/07/arcelormittal-ny-registered-shs-mt-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"MT 2020 Q1","e":"mt","d":"2020-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Seth Rosenfeld","x":"If I can start off with regards to cost savings, can you please give us a bit more color with regards to what efforts are made to cut fixed costs across the major regions contributing to that guidance for 25%, 30% Q-on-Q reduction in fixed costs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/09/arcelormittal-ny-registered-shs-mt-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"MT 2020 Q1","e":"mt","d":"2020-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aditya Mittal","x":"But clearly to the extent that we need to make variable cost savings or structural cost savings, ArcelorMittal would do that to adjust to the new demand levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/202