rcelormittal-ny-registered-shs-mt-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"MT 2020 Q3","e":"mt","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aditya Mittal","x":"So those were all temporary cost savings, designed to adapt to the lower productive capacity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/arcelormittal-ny-registered-shs-mt-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"MT 2020 Q4","e":"mt","d":"2021-02-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christian","x":"In a scenario where your share price increases materially and perhaps the share buyback impact is less obvious, would you consider changing that for a dividend payment?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/arcelormittal-ny-registered-shs-mt-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"MT 2020 Q4","e":"mt","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jack","x":"And perhaps just one follow-up, if I can, which is, obviously, you've now disposed of the AMUSA assets, and you've announced the fixed cost reduction this morning.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/arcelormittal-ny-registered-shs-mt-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"MT 2020 Q4","e":"mt","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carsten","x":"I have a question on the $1 billion fixed cost reduction plan, as it is shown on Slide 11.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/arcelormittal-ny-registered-shs-mt-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"MT 2021 Q1","e":"mt","d":"2021-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Aditya Mittal","x":"Sure, the safeguard is designed to safeguard right from a surge of imports and that risk remains, the safeguards were put in place, section 232, was put in place in the United States, Section 232 remains in place in the United States, so the logic of safeguard is still there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/08/arcelormittal-ny-registered-shs-mt-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"MT 2021 Q1","e":"mt","d":"2021-05-07","l":"cost_cuts"